; matrix case M-control-112: RAM:ev/asciitable/asciitable under EmuV0 112, from a fresh boot
Failat 30
Execute RAM:rxt/setup112.script
Echo >RESULTS:M-control-112.txt "run M-control-112"
Version RAM:emu112/EmuV0-pc FULL >>RESULTS:M-control-112.txt
Echo "== LIBSV0" >>RESULTS:M-control-112.txt
List LIBSV0: FILES LFORMAT="%n %l" >>RESULTS:M-control-112.txt
Echo "== starting emulator" >>RESULTS:M-control-112.txt
RAM:emu112/EmuV0-pc >RESULTS:M-control-112-out.txt RAM:ev/asciitable/asciitable
Echo "== emulator returned $RC" >>RESULTS:M-control-112.txt
